i. construction or upgradation of rural roads, culverts, cross - drainage structures and village connectivity facilities;

ii. construction of Village Panchayat Offices, Anganwadi centres, rural libraries and other public buildings;

lii.construction of school infrastructure, including kitchen sheds, additional classrooms, laboratories, compound walls and playgrounds;

iv.crematoria and community infrastructure;

